<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_title">Position information emerges in causal transformers without positional encodings via similarity of nearby embeddings</span>.
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_inbook">Proceedings of the 31st International Conference on Computational Linguistics</span>,
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_pages">pp. 9418–9430</span>.
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S1.p2.1" title="1 Introduction ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§1</span></a>,
<a href="#S1.p3.1" title="1 Introduction ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§1</span></a>,
<a href="#S3.p2.1" title="3 Empirical Analysis ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§3</span></a>,
<a href="#S3.p6.1" title="3 Empirical Analysis ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§3</span></a>.
</span></li>
</ul>
</section>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Proofs</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 1. ‣ 2.2 LayerNorm ‣ 2 Theoretical Analysis ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We additionally present the skipped derivation of Equation <a href="#S2.E5" title="In 2.2 LayerNorm ‣ 2 Theoretical Analysis ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, starting from <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{ij}^{(2)}=\frac{d\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle}{\sqrt{d}||x_{i}^{(1)}||\cdot||x_{j}^{(1)}||}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{ij}^{(2)}=\frac{d\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle}{\sqrt{d}||x_{i}^{(1)}||\cdot||x_{j}^{(1)}||}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.EGx8" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_gather ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\big(\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle\big)_{i&gt;j}=\frac{(e^{\sqrt{d}}y_{i}^{(1)}+\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}y^{(1)}_{k})(e^{\sqrt{d}}y_{j}^{(1)}+\sum_{l=1}^{j-1}y^{(1)}_{l})}{(e^{\sqrt{d}}+i-1)(e^{\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\big(\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle\big)_{i&gt;j}=\frac{(e^{\sqrt{d}}y_{i}^{(1)}+\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}y^{(1)}_{k})(e^{\sqrt{d}}y_{j}^{(1)}+\sum_{l=1}^{j-1}y^{(1)}_{l})}{(e^{\sqrt{d}}+i-1)(e^{\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(7)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{e^{2\sqrt{d}}\langle y_{i}^{(1)},y_{j}^{(1)}\rangle+e^{\sqrt{d}}\sum_{l=1}^{j-1}\langle y^{(1)}_{i},y^{(1)}_{l}\rangle+e^{\sqrt{d}}\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}\langle y^{(1)}_{j},y^{(1)}_{k}\rangle+\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}\sum_{l=1}^{j-1}\langle y^{(1)}_{k}y^{(1)}_{l}\rangle}{(e^{\sqrt{d}}+i-1)(e^{\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{e^{2\sqrt{d}}\langle y_{i}^{(1)},y_{j}^{(1)}\rangle+e^{\sqrt{d}}\sum_{l=1}^{j-1}\langle y^{(1)}_{i},y^{(1)}_{l}\rangle+e^{\sqrt{d}}\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}\langle y^{(1)}_{j},y^{(1)}_{k}\rangle+\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}\sum_{l=1}^{j-1}\langle y^{(1)}_{k}y^{(1)}_{l}\rangle}{(e^{\sqrt{d}}+i-1)(e^{\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(8)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">By the law of large numbers, <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\langle y^{(1)}_{i},y^{(1)}_{j}\rangle=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle y^{(1)}_{i},y^{(1)}_{j}\rangle=0</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\neq j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\neq j</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\langle y^{(1)}_{i},y^{(1)}_{i}\rangle=d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle y^{(1)}_{i},y^{(1)}_{i}\rangle=d</annotation></semantics></math>.
Thus,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx9" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\big(\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle\big)_{i&gt;j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\big(\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle\big)_{i&gt;j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{d(e^{\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}{(e^{\sqrt{d}}+i-1)(e^{\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{d(e^{\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}{(e^{\sqrt{d}}+i-1)(e^{\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">For the <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="||x_{i}^{(1)}||" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">||x_{i}^{(1)}||</annotation></semantics></math> term in the denominator, we again apply the law of large numbers to the case <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=j</annotation></semantics></math> in Eq. <a href="#A1.E8" title="In Proof. ‣ A.1 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix A Proofs ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx10" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle||x^{(1)}_{i}||_{2}^{2}=\langle x^{(1)}_{i},x^{(1)}_{i}\rangle=\frac{d(e^{2\sqrt{d}}+i-1)}{(e^{\sqrt{d}}+i-1)^{2}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle||x^{(1)}_{i}||_{2}^{2}=\langle x^{(1)}_{i},x^{(1)}_{i}\rangle=\frac{d(e^{2\sqrt{d}}+i-1)}{(e^{\sqrt{d}}+i-1)^{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore, for <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i&gt;j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i&gt;j</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx11" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle S_{ij}^{(2)}=\frac{\langle y^{(2)}_{i},y^{(2)}_{j}\rangle}{\sqrt{d}}=\frac{d\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle}{{\sqrt{d}}||x^{(1)}_{i}||_{2}\cdot||x^{(1)}_{j}||_{2}}=\frac{\sqrt{d}(e^{\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}{\sqrt{e^{2\sqrt{d}}+i-1}\sqrt{e^{2\sqrt{d}}+j-1}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle S_{ij}^{(2)}=\frac{\langle y^{(2)}_{i},y^{(2)}_{j}\rangle}{\sqrt{d}}=\frac{d\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle}{{\sqrt{d}}||x^{(1)}_{i}||_{2}\cdot||x^{(1)}_{j}||_{2}}=\frac{\sqrt{d}(e^{\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}{\sqrt{e^{2\sqrt{d}}+i-1}\sqrt{e^{2\sqrt{d}}+j-1}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p2.4.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math> are positive integers and the order of <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math> in the numerator is larger than that in the denominator, <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{ij}^{(2)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{ij}^{(2)}</annotation></semantics></math> is strictly increasing in <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math> for a fixed <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Proof of Proposition <a href="#Thmproposition1" title="Proposition 1. ‣ 2.2 LayerNorm ‣ 2 Theoretical Analysis ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Without LayerNorm,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx12" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle S^{(1)}_{ij}=\mathrm{Causal}(X^{(0)}X^{(0)\top}/\sqrt{d})_{ij}=\begin{cases}\langle x_{i},x_{i}\rangle/\sqrt{d}&amp;(i=j)\\
\langle x_{i},x_{j}\rangle/\sqrt{d}&amp;(i&gt;j)\\
-\inf&amp;(i&lt;j)\end{cases}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>Causal</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>X</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mo lspace="0.222em">⁣</mo><mo>inf</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle S^{(1)}_{ij}=\mathrm{Causal}(X^{(0)}X^{(0)\top}/\sqrt{d})_{ij}=\begin{cases}\langle x_{i},x_{i}\rangle/\sqrt{d}&amp;(i=j)\\
\langle x_{i},x_{j}\rangle/\sqrt{d}&amp;(i&gt;j)\\
-\inf&amp;(i&lt;j)\end{cases}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text">Proceeding in the same manner as in the previous proof, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx13" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle A^{(1)}_{ij}=\begin{cases}\frac{e^{\langle x_{i},x_{i}\rangle/\sqrt{d}}}{e^{\langle x_{i},x_{i}\rangle/\sqrt{d}}+\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}e^{\langle x_{i},x_{k}\rangle/\sqrt{d}}}&amp;(i=j)\\
\frac{e^{\langle x_{i},x_{j}\rangle/\sqrt{d}}}{e^{\langle x_{i},x_{i}\rangle/\sqrt{d}}+\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}e^{\langle x_{i},x_{k}\rangle/\sqrt{d}}}&amp;(i&gt;j)\\
0&amp;(i&lt;j)\end{cases}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><msubsup><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><msubsup><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle A^{(1)}_{ij}=\begin{cases}\frac{e^{\langle x_{i},x_{i}\rangle/\sqrt{d}}}{e^{\langle x_{i},x_{i}\rangle/\sqrt{d}}+\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}e^{\langle x_{i},x_{k}\rangle/\sqrt{d}}}&amp;(i=j)\\
\frac{e^{\langle x_{i},x_{j}\rangle/\sqrt{d}}}{e^{\langle x_{i},x_{i}\rangle/\sqrt{d}}+\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}e^{\langle x_{i},x_{k}\rangle/\sqrt{d}}}&amp;(i&gt;j)\\
0&amp;(i&lt;j)\end{cases}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text">Here, we can apply the law of large numbers. Thus,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx14" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\langle x^{(0)}_{i},x^{(0)}_{j}\rangle=\begin{cases}1&amp;(i=j)\\
\approx 0&amp;(i\neq j).\end{cases}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\langle x^{(0)}_{i},x^{(0)}_{j}\rangle=\begin{cases}1&amp;(i=j)\\
\approx 0&amp;(i\neq j).\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p1.4.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx15" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle A_{ij}^{(1)}=\begin{cases}\frac{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}}{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+(i-1)}&amp;(i=j)\\
\frac{1}{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+(i-1)}&amp;(i&gt;j)\\
0&amp;(i&lt;j)\end{cases}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle A_{ij}^{(1)}=\begin{cases}\frac{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}}{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+(i-1)}&amp;(i=j)\\
\frac{1}{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+(i-1)}&amp;(i&gt;j)\\
0&amp;(i&lt;j)\end{cases}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p1.5.1" class="ltx_text">Thus,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle x_{i}^{(1)}=\sum_{j=1}^{i}A_{ij}^{(1)}x_{j}^{(1)}=\frac{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}x_{i}^{(1)}+\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}x_{k}^{(1)}}{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+i-1}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle x_{i}^{(1)}=\sum_{j=1}^{i}A_{ij}^{(1)}x_{j}^{(1)}=\frac{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}x_{i}^{(1)}+\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}x_{k}^{(1)}}{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+i-1},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A1.EGx17" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\big(S_{ij}^{(2)}\big)_{i&gt;j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\big(S_{ij}^{(2)}\big)_{i&gt;j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle=\frac{(e^{1/\sqrt{d}}x_{i}^{(1)}+\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}x_{k}^{(1)})(e^{1/\sqrt{d}}x_{j}^{(1)}+\sum_{l=1}^{j-1}x_{l}^{(1)})}{(e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+i-1)(e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>l</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle=\frac{(e^{1/\sqrt{d}}x_{i}^{(1)}+\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}x_{k}^{(1)})(e^{1/\sqrt{d}}x_{j}^{(1)}+\sum_{l=1}^{j-1}x_{l}^{(1)})}{(e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+i-1)(e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E18.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+j-1}{(e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+i-1)(e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+j-1}{(e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+i-1)(e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+j-1)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+i-1}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{e^{1/\sqrt{d}}+i-1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p1.6.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore, the attention score in the second layer without LayerNorm does not exhibit recency bias.∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Proof of Proposition <a href="#Thmproposition2" title="Proposition 2. ‣ 2.3 Residual Connection ‣ 2 Theoretical Analysis ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> and <a href="#Thmproposition3" title="Proposition 3. ‣ 2.4 Distribution of Input Token Embeddings ‣ 2 Theoretical Analysis ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a></h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here, we consider both anisotropic input embeddings and residual connections.
To incorporate these effects, we rewrite Eq. <a href="#S2.E2" title="In 2.2 LayerNorm ‣ 2 Theoretical Analysis ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> to include residual networks:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx18" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle f(X)=\mathrm{Softmax}(\mathrm{Causal}(YY^{\top})/\sqrt{d})Y+\gamma X," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>Softmax</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Causal</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>Y</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle f(X)=\mathrm{Softmax}(\mathrm{Causal}(YY^{\top})/\sqrt{d})Y+\gamma X,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E21"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle Y=\sqrt{d}X/||X||_{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle Y=\sqrt{d}X/||X||_{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math> is a constant: <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma=0</annotation></semantics></math> corresponds to the model without residual connections, and <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma=1</annotation></semantics></math> corresponds to the model with residual connections.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">We first compute the expectation of <math id="A1.SS3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\langle y_{i}^{(0)},y_{j}^{(0)}\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle y_{i}^{(0)},y_{j}^{(0)}\rangle</annotation></semantics></math> when <math id="A1.SS3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\neq j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\neq j</annotation></semantics></math>.
For the denominator,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx19" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E22"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\big[||x_{i}^{(1)}||_{2}^{2}\big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}\big[||x_{i}^{(1)}||_{2}^{2}\big]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E22.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}\big[(\epsilon_{i}+\sqrt{\frac{\alpha}{1-\alpha}}v)(\epsilon_{i}+\sqrt{\frac{\alpha}{1-\alpha}}v)\big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}\big[(\epsilon_{i}+\sqrt{\frac{\alpha}{1-\alpha}}v)(\epsilon_{i}+\sqrt{\frac{\alpha}{1-\alpha}}v)\big]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E23"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[\langle\epsilon_{i},\epsilon_{i}\rangle]+2\sqrt{\frac{\alpha}{1-\alpha}}\mathbb{E}[\langle\epsilon_{i},v\rangle]+\frac{\alpha}{1-\alpha}\mathbb{E}[\langle v,v\rangle]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[\langle\epsilon_{i},\epsilon_{i}\rangle]+2\sqrt{\frac{\alpha}{1-\alpha}}\mathbb{E}[\langle\epsilon_{i},v\rangle]+\frac{\alpha}{1-\alpha}\mathbb{E}[\langle v,v\rangle].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(23)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A1.SS3.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\gg 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≫</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\gg 1</annotation></semantics></math>, the inner product in the second term is negligible compared to those in the first and third terms.
Thus, <math id="A1.SS3.p2.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbb{E}\big[\||x_{i}^{(1)}||_{2}^{2}\big]\approx{\sqrt{d}}/({1-\alpha})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow><mo>≈</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}\big[\||x_{i}^{(1)}||_{2}^{2}\big]\approx{\sqrt{d}}/({1-\alpha})</annotation></semantics></math>.
Therefore,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E24"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\langle y_{i}^{(0)},y_{j}^{(0)}\rangle=\sqrt{d}\frac{(\epsilon_{i}+cv)(\epsilon_{j}+cv)}{\frac{d}{1-\alpha}}=\sqrt{d}\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\langle y_{i}^{(0)},y_{j}^{(0)}\rangle=\sqrt{d}\frac{(\epsilon_{i}+cv)(\epsilon_{j}+cv)}{\frac{d}{1-\alpha}}=\sqrt{d}\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(24)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text">Following the same procedure as in the above proof, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E25"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle x_{i}^{(1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle x_{i}^{(1)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E25.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{j=1}^{i}A_{ij}^{(1)}y_{j}^{(1)}+\gamma x_{j}^{(1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{j=1}^{i}A_{ij}^{(1)}y_{j}^{(1)}+\gamma x_{j}^{(1)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(25)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E26"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{e^{\sqrt{d}}y_{i}^{(1)}+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}y_{k}^{(1)}}{e^{\sqrt{d}}+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-1)}+\sqrt{d}\gamma||x^{(1)}_{i}||_{2}y_{i}^{(1)}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{e^{\sqrt{d}}y_{i}^{(1)}+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}y_{k}^{(1)}}{e^{\sqrt{d}}+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-1)}+\sqrt{d}\gamma||x^{(1)}_{i}||_{2}y_{i}^{(1)}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(26)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.4.1" class="ltx_text">We denote the denominator by <math id="A1.SS3.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, so that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx22" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E27"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle x_{i}^{(1)}=\frac{(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})y_{i}^{(1)}+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}y_{k}^{(1)}}{D_{i}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle x_{i}^{(1)}=\frac{(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})y_{i}^{(1)}+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}y_{k}^{(1)}}{D_{i}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(27)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.EGx23" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\big(\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle\big)_{i&gt;j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\big(\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle\big)_{i&gt;j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex7.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{D_{i}D_{j}}\bigg[((d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})y_{i}^{(1)}+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}y_{k}^{(1)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{D_{i}D_{j}}\bigg[((d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})y_{i}^{(1)}+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}\sum_{k=1}^{i-1}y_{k}^{(1)})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E28"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E28.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\times((d\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})y_{j}^{(1)}+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}\sum_{l=1}^{j-1}y_{l}^{(1)})\bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\times((d\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})y_{j}^{(1)}+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}\sum_{l=1}^{j-1}y_{l}^{(1)})\bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(28)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{d}{D_{i}D_{j}}\bigg[\alpha(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})(d\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})(j-1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mi>α</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{d}{D_{i}D_{j}}\bigg[\alpha(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})(d\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})(j-1)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(d\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})(i-2)+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(d\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+e^{2\sqrt{d}\alpha}(j-1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(d\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})(i-2)+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(d\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+e^{2\sqrt{d}\alpha}(j-1)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E29"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E29.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\alpha e^{2\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-2)(j-1)\bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\alpha e^{2\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-2)(j-1)\bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(29)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{d}{D_{i}D_{j}}\bigg[(j-1)(\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+e^{2\sqrt{d}\alpha}+\alpha e^{2\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-2))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{d}{D_{i}D_{j}}\bigg[(j-1)(\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+e^{2\sqrt{d}\alpha}+\alpha e^{2\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-2))</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E30"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E30.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+(d\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})(\alpha(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-2)+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha})\bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+(d\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})(\alpha(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-2)+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha})\bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(30)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E31"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=d\frac{(e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(j-1)+d\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})(\alpha(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}+\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-2))}{D_{i}D_{j}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=d\frac{(e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(j-1)+d\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})(\alpha(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}+\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-2))}{D_{i}D_{j}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(31)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E32"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=d\frac{D_{j}(1+d\gamma)(\alpha(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}+\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-2))}{D_{i}D_{j}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=d\frac{D_{j}(1+d\gamma)(\alpha(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}+\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-2))}{D_{i}D_{j}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(32)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E33"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=d\frac{(1+d\gamma)(\alpha(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}+\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-2))}{D_{i}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=d\frac{(1+d\gamma)(\alpha(d\gamma D_{i}+e^{\sqrt{d}})+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}+\alpha e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(i-2))}{D_{i}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(33)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Formally, we aim to show that <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{ij}^{(2)}&gt;S_{ik}^{(2)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{ij}^{(2)}&gt;S_{ik}^{(2)}</annotation></semantics></math> for any <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\geq j&gt;k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\geq j&gt;k</annotation></semantics></math>.
Since <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{ij}^{(2)}=d\frac{\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle}{||x_{i}^{(1)}||\cdot||x_{j}^{(1)}||}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{ij}^{(2)}=d\frac{\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle}{||x_{i}^{(1)}||\cdot||x_{j}^{(1)}||}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the numerator and <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="||x_{i}^{(1)}||_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">||x_{i}^{(1)}||_{2}</annotation></semantics></math> are independent of <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>, it suffices to show that <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="||x_{j}^{(1)}||_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">||x_{j}^{(1)}||_{2}</annotation></semantics></math> is strictly decreasing in <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p4" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.EGx24" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E34"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle||x_{j}^{(1)}||^{2}_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle||x_{j}^{(1)}||^{2}_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E34.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{((\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})y_{j}^{(1)}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}}\sum_{k=1}^{j-1}y_{k}^{(1)})((\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})y_{j}^{(1)}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}}\sum_{k=1}^{j-1}y_{k}^{(1)})}{D_{j}D_{j}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{((\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})y_{j}^{(1)}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}}\sum_{k=1}^{j-1}y_{k}^{(1)})((\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})y_{j}^{(1)}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}}\sum_{k=1}^{j-1}y_{k}^{(1)})}{D_{j}D_{j}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(34)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{d}{D_{j}^{2}}\bigg[(\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})^{2}+2d\alpha(\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})de^{\alpha\sqrt{d}}(j-1)+e^{2\alpha\sqrt{d}}(j-1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>α</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{d}{D_{j}^{2}}\bigg[(\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})^{2}+2d\alpha(\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})de^{\alpha\sqrt{d}}(j-1)+e^{2\alpha\sqrt{d}}(j-1)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E35"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E35.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+d\alpha e^{2\alpha\sqrt{d}}(j-2)(j-1)\bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>α</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+d\alpha e^{2\alpha\sqrt{d}}(j-2)(j-1)\bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(35)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{d}{D_{j}^{2}}\bigg[(\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})^{2}+2(\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})\alpha(D_{j}-e^{\sqrt{d}})+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(D_{j}-e^{\sqrt{d}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>α</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{d}{D_{j}^{2}}\bigg[(\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})^{2}+2(\gamma D_{j}+e^{\sqrt{d}})\alpha(D_{j}-e^{\sqrt{d}})+e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha}(D_{j}-e^{\sqrt{d}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E36"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E36.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\alpha(D_{j}-e^{\sqrt{d}}-e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha})(D_{j}-e^{\sqrt{d}})\bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\alpha(D_{j}-e^{\sqrt{d}}-e^{\sqrt{d}\alpha})(D_{j}-e^{\sqrt{d}})\bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(36)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E37"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=d\frac{D_{j}^{2}(\gamma^{2}+2\alpha\gamma+\alpha)+D_{j}(1-\alpha)(2\gamma e^{\sqrt{d}}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}})+(1-\alpha)(e^{2\sqrt{d}}-e^{\sqrt{d}+\sqrt{d}\alpha})}{D_{j}^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=d\frac{D_{j}^{2}(\gamma^{2}+2\alpha\gamma+\alpha)+D_{j}(1-\alpha)(2\gamma e^{\sqrt{d}}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}})+(1-\alpha)(e^{2\sqrt{d}}-e^{\sqrt{d}+\sqrt{d}\alpha})}{D_{j}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(37)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A1.SS3.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="||x_{j}^{(1)}||_{2}\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">||x_{j}^{(1)}||_{2}\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, it suffices to show that <math id="A1.SS3.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="||x_{j+1}^{(1)}||_{2}^{2}-||x_{j}^{(1)}||_{2}^{2}&lt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">||x_{j+1}^{(1)}||_{2}^{2}-||x_{j}^{(1)}||_{2}^{2}&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx25" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E38"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle||x_{j+1}^{(1)}||^{2}_{2}-||x_{j}^{(1)}||^{2}_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle||x_{j+1}^{(1)}||^{2}_{2}-||x_{j}^{(1)}||^{2}_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(38)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E39"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=d(1-\alpha)(2\gamma e^{\sqrt{d}}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}})({1\over D_{j+1}}-{1\over D_{j}})+d(1-\alpha)(e^{2\sqrt{d}}-e^{\sqrt{d}+\alpha\sqrt{d}})({1\over D_{j+1}^{2}}-{1\over D_{j}^{2}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=d(1-\alpha)(2\gamma e^{\sqrt{d}}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}})({1\over D_{j+1}}-{1\over D_{j}})+d(1-\alpha)(e^{2\sqrt{d}}-e^{\sqrt{d}+\alpha\sqrt{d}})({1\over D_{j+1}^{2}}-{1\over D_{j}^{2}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(39)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E40"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E40.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=d(1-\alpha)(2\gamma e^{\sqrt{d}}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}})({-e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}}\over D_{j}D_{j+1}})+d(1-\alpha)(e^{2\sqrt{d}}-e^{\sqrt{d}+\sqrt{d}\alpha})({-e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}}(2D_{j}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}})\over D_{j}^{2}D_{j+1}^{2}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=d(1-\alpha)(2\gamma e^{\sqrt{d}}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}})({-e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}}\over D_{j}D_{j+1}})+d(1-\alpha)(e^{2\sqrt{d}}-e^{\sqrt{d}+\sqrt{d}\alpha})({-e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}}(2D_{j}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}})\over D_{j}^{2}D_{j+1}^{2}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(40)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p4.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p4.2.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A1.SS3.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0\leq\alpha&lt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0\leq\alpha&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math>, both terms are strictly negative.
Therefore, <math id="A1.SS3.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="||x_{j}^{(1)}||_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">||x_{j}^{(1)}||_{2}</annotation></semantics></math> is strictly decreasing in <math id="A1.SS3.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>.
Consequently, <math id="A1.SS3.p4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{ij}^{(2)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{ij}^{(2)}</annotation></semantics></math> is strictly increasing in <math id="A1.SS3.p4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math> for fixed <math id="A1.SS3.p4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>, exhibiting a recency bias regardless of the presence of residual connections or the anisotropy of the input embeddings.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">From the above proof, since <math id="A1.SS3.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle</annotation></semantics></math> is independent of <math id="A1.SS3.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</p>
<table id="A1.EGx26" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E41"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\big(S_{ij}^{(2)}\big)_{i&gt;j}=d\frac{\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle}{||x_{i}^{(1)}||\cdot||x_{j}^{(1)}||}=\bigg(d\frac{\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle}{||x_{i}^{(1)}||}\bigg)\bigg(\frac{1}{||x_{j}^{(1)}||}\bigg)=g(i)\cdot h(j)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\big(S_{ij}^{(2)}\big)_{i&gt;j}=d\frac{\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle}{||x_{i}^{(1)}||\cdot||x_{j}^{(1)}||}=\bigg(d\frac{\langle x_{i}^{(1)},x_{j}^{(1)}\rangle}{||x_{i}^{(1)}||}\bigg)\bigg(\frac{1}{||x_{j}^{(1)}||}\bigg)=g(i)\cdot h(j).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(41)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p5.2" class="ltx_p">Therefore,</p>
<table id="A1.EGx27" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E42"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle h(j)=\frac{D_{j}}{\sqrt{d}\sqrt{D_{j}^{2}(\gamma^{2}+2\alpha\gamma+\alpha)+D_{j}(1-\alpha)(2\gamma e^{\sqrt{d}}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}})+(1-\alpha)(e^{2\sqrt{d}}-e^{\sqrt{d}+\sqrt{d}\alpha})}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle h(j)=\frac{D_{j}}{\sqrt{d}\sqrt{D_{j}^{2}(\gamma^{2}+2\alpha\gamma+\alpha)+D_{j}(1-\alpha)(2\gamma e^{\sqrt{d}}+e^{\alpha\sqrt{d}})+(1-\alpha)(e^{2\sqrt{d}}-e^{\sqrt{d}+\sqrt{d}\alpha})}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(42)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Extended Results</h2>

<figure id="A2.F3" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.21042v4/fig3_d16_d64_L3L4.png" id="A2.F3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/399;" width="476" height="399" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Visualization of the attention scores for layers 3 and 4 with <math id="A2.F3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=16" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d=16</annotation></semantics></math> (left) and <math id="A2.F3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=64" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d=64</annotation></semantics></math> (right). The layout follows Figure <a href="#S2.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 2.2 LayerNorm ‣ 2 Theoretical Analysis ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.F4" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.21042v4/fig2_d256_d1024_L1L2.png" id="A2.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/395;" width="476" height="395" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>Visualization of the attention scores for layers 1 and 2 with <math id="A2.F4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=256" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d=256</annotation></semantics></math> (left) and <math id="A2.F4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=1024" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1024</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d=1024</annotation></semantics></math> (right). The layout follows Figure <a href="#S2.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 2.2 LayerNorm ‣ 2 Theoretical Analysis ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.21042v4/simul_alpha.png" id="A2.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/408;" width="476" height="408" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>Extended results of Figure <a href="#S2.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 2.2 LayerNorm ‣ 2 Theoretical Analysis ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> with multiple <math id="A2.F5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> values and no residual connections.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.F6" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.21042v4/simul_alpha_residual.png" id="A2.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/508;" width="476" height="508" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Extended results of Figure <a href="#S2.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 2.2 LayerNorm ‣ 2 Theoretical Analysis ‣ LayerNorm Induces Recency Bias in Transformer Decoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> with multiple <math id="A2.F6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> values and with residual connections.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.F7" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.21042v4/alpha_resid.svg" id="A2.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/313;" width="476" height="313"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Visualization of <math id="A2.F7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h(j)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h(j)</annotation></semantics></math> over key index <math id="A2.F7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>, for multiple values of <math id="A2.F7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>, including residual connections.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
